export function createTimeAttackMode({hard:e=!1}={}){const t=e?30:45;return Object.freeze({id:"timeAttack",seconds:t,record:Object.freeze({key:"bestTime",field:"time"}),getStatus({seconds:e,moves:o,completed:s},c){const n=Math.max(0,t-e);return{seconds:n,moves:o,timeLow:!s&&n<=c,movesLow:!1}},getDefeatReason:({seconds:e})=>e>=t?"timeExpired":null})}
